  <para style="h">2 Johane</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukwalo Gwebubili gwaJohane</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Johane</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Joh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lukwalo Gwebubili</para>
  <para style="mt1">gwaJOHANE</para>
  <para style="imt">Tjinginiso</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Lukwalo gwebuBubili gwaJohane</char> gwakakwagwa ndimpositoli Johane pakati kwemakole alimakumi mahanu kunoti aligulu hule kwezwagwa kwaKhirisitu. Johane haatozwitula senkwali, koga unozwidana eti whola. Zila lukwalo gwa2 Johane yagwakakwagwa ndiyo inofanana nezila Ndebo mbuya sekwagwa kwayo ndiJohane yayakakwagwa ndiyo. Ikoku kupatjena nezila yaanokuludzila nlayo waYesu wekuti tidane nangezila yaanobiga nayo da Yesu netobela milayo iye. (2 Johane 1.5-6, Johane 15.9-10). Kokumbuligwa kuti Johane ndiye wakakwala Ndebo Mbuya sekwagwa ndiyo ndiJohane newhalo nhatu 1 Johane, 2 Johane na 3 Johane etjagala kuEfesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Johane wakakwala lukwalo igogu akagulingisa kumfumakadzi wakahagwa nebana babe. Wakafanila waka ebva gubungano lebagalimoyo. Tjinangwa tjaJohane tjekwala lukwalo igogu tjakatjili tjekuludzila gubungano nepa tjenjedzo nekwebadiyi bemanyepwa</para>
  <para style="iot">Nlongoloso Yezwimukati</para>
  <para style="io1">Johane unotangisa lukwalo elakidza kuti ndegwa yani nebuyisa beni bago (2 Johane1.1-3)</para>
  <para style="io1">Unotobela nekuludzila gubungano nelikumbudza nekwenlayo nkulu ( 2 Johane1.4-6)</para>
  <para style="io1">Unotobela nepa tjenjedzo nekwebadiyi bemanyepwa ( 2 Johane 1.7-11).</para>
  <para style="io1">Johane unofidza lukwalo gugwe nezibisa kuti bagalimoyo bamugubungano kwaakabe egala banobuyisa ( 2 Johane 1.12-13).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1" />Kubva kuWhola.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2JN 1:1">Kumfumakadzi wakahagwa neNdzimu nekubana babe, bandinoda ngelebeswa, kusi imi ndoga koga nebamwe bose banoziba lebeswa, <verse eid="2JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2" />nentha yelebeswa linogala mutili linowhoba naswi nekusingapele.<verse eid="2JN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3" />Ngoni, nemawhilangoni nekunyalala kunobva kuNdzimu Tate nekuna Yesu Khirisitu, Nkololo waTate, kowhoba kutili mulebeswa nemuludo.<verse eid="2JN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lebeswa neLudo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4" />Ndakahanha kwazo ndiwana bamwe bebana babo betobelela malebeswa, sekwatakalayiwa naTate. <verse eid="2JN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5" />Sangwenu ndokukumbila, mfumakadzi, ndisingakukwalile nlayo ntshwa, koga iwhoyo watakabe tinawo kubvisila kutanga, kuti tidanane. <verse eid="2JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6" />Igogu ndigo ludo. kuti titjile ngetobela milayo iye. Sekwamakawha kubvisila kutanga, nlayo uwe ndewekuti mutjile muli muludo.<verse eid="2JN 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7" />Ngobe batjebeli banjinji batjihhala muhango, banhu basingabvume kuti Yesu Khirisitu wakahha ali nhu, nhu wakajali untjebeli kakale utjita tjaKhirisitu. <verse eid="2JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8" />Yelani njele, kuti musilahikigwe nekwamakahingila, koga muwamutjile mbhayilo uhhele.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dzimwe whalo whulukugwi dzoti kuti tisilahikigwe nekwatakahingila, koga muwamutjile mbhayilo uhhele</char></note> <verse eid="2JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9" />Kene yani unotjuluka kakale asingatobele tjidiyo tjaKhirisitu haana Ndzimu, unogala mutjidiyo unabose bubili gwabo Tate neNkololo. <verse eid="2JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10" />Hapa kene yani ehha kumuli esingahhise tjidiyo itjetji, musiwuwamutjile munzi wenyu kene iko wunlezwa, <verse eid="2JN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11" />ngobe unowunlezwa unohanganyila naye mumihingo iye yakayipa.<verse eid="2JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matama ebupelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12" />Nekene ndinakunjinji kwandingamukwalila, kuhine ndisihingise phepha kene inki, koga ndakalingilila kuti ndimukumbe ndilebeleke namwi takalingisana kudze kuti hanha kwedu kube kwakapelela.<verse eid="2JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13" />Bana bemfumakadzi wakahagwa banokubuyisa.<verse eid="2JN 1:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1" />
</usx>